        ]
      },
      {
        "finding": "In generation CB-LLMs on Llama3-8B, the highest-activating concept neuron identified the dataset label with accuracy within 1% of a finetuned classifier.",
        "proposed_claim": "Supervised concept neurons in generative LLMs can detect their target concepts about as accurately as a black-box classifier.",
        "row_ids": [
