    "problems": "The neuron evaluations concern intentionally trained concept bottlenecks rather than natural neurons in an ordinary pretrained model. Activation faithfulness is rated on top-activating examples, not tested by predicting activations on held-out text. The reported table values have no uncertainty estimates.",
