    "verdict_notes": "No originals are cited and the claim is never discussed. The 'discusses' relation is kept only as the loosest available option; T6 is the accurate tranche. The neurons studied are engineered via concept-label training, so they are deliberately induced interpretability, not evidence about neurons in ordinary pretrained networks. Task 1 rated only the 5 most highly activated neurons per dataset."
